# AI Web Agency - Rules for Cursor / Windsurf

- Test command: `.venv\Scripts\pytest.exe -q`
- CLI command: `.venv\Scripts\agency.exe <command>`
- This project uses graphify (`graphify-out/`) for architecture understanding.
- Query graph with: `.venv\Scripts\graphify.exe query "<question>"`
- Keep the graph updated after modifying code: `.venv\Scripts\graphify.exe update .`
- Always respect compliance rules: no hardcoded secrets, no fabricated business facts, testable modular code.
